OVERVIEW: Validate a DICOMDIR file

USAGE: dicom-dcmdir validate <dicomdir-path> [--check-files] [--detailed]

ARGUMENTS:
  <dicomdir-path>         Path to DICOMDIR file

OPTIONS:
  --check-files           Check that every Referenced File ID (0004,1500) names
                          a file in the File-set (PS3.10 8.6)
  --detailed              Detailed validation output
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

